# sleep(1)

## NAME

sleep - wait for an amount of time

## SYNOPSIS

    sleep seconds[s|m|h|d]...

## DESCRIPTION

Waits for the given time. Decimals are allowed (`0.5`). The suffixes mean seconds, minutes, hours and days. Several values are added together. The process uses no CPU while it waits.

